   "A living entity's health and shared flags from set-entity-data, skimmed"
   "Which entity types are living (only they have health at the metadata's index 9), from the game's classes"
   "Death as a fact: entity-event status 3, then the removal"]
  :problem/decisions
  ["Velocity is the game's LpVec3, read from the jar (probe run 38876275250), not three shorts in 1/8000 blocks"
   "The metadata skim reads only simple serializers and stops at the first other, keeping what it read"
   "Living types and their maximum health come from DefaultAttributes by jar-probe (mobs.edn), never a hand list"
   "Hostile is the game's monster category minus the neutral ones (enderman, zombified piglin)"]
  :problem/risks ["A pig beside a drop taken for the drop now that every entity is tracked"
