  :problem/statement
  "Split from :end-and-dragon. Twelve eyes of ender need twelve ender pearls, and bartering for them takes far more gold than the run mines, so the bot hunts endermen: find one, make it come, kill it with the sword and live, pick up the pearl it drops one time in two, about twenty-four times."
